OL,3,GNEWSAThree arrests by police using
OL,4,Afacial recognition
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree arrests were made after live
OL,7,Ffacial recognition (LFR) was deployed
OL,8,Fin Cambridge for the first time.
OL,10,FThe technology was used by
OL,11,FCambridgeshire Police on Friday, which
OL,12,Fsaid it had scanned 29,361 faces. Of
OL,13,Fthose, police said four matches were
OL,14,Fmade against a watchlist of 917 people.
OL,16,FOfficers said three men were arrested
OL,17,Fduring the six-hour operation,
OL,18,Fincluding a 63-year-old and a
OL,19,F39-year-old who were arrested for
OL,20,Ffailing to appear in court.
